---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Support"
  description="Support Taj's Mods development. Learn about ways to contribute, report issues, and help the project grow."
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 relative overflow-hidden border-b border-outline-variant">
    <div class="container-wide text-center relative z-10">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-on-background">Support the Project</h1>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
        Help keep the Modding Lab growing and improving.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-surface-tint/5 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="section relative z-10">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <!-- Transparency Notice -->
      <div
        class="glass-card bg-emerald-500/5 border-emerald-500/20 mb-12 p-8 rounded-2xl"
      >
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="text-3xl">🔒</div>
          <div>
            <h2
              class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-300"
            >
              Full Transparency
            </h2>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant">
              Taj's Mods ecosystem is completely free and open source. There are
              no hidden paywalls, no locked features, and no "premium" tiers.
              All gameplay-affecting features are clearly labeled and optional.
              Your tokens and progression are never touched without explicit
              action from you.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Ways to Support -->
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-on-background">Ways to Support</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">⭐</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-on-background">Rate on Workshop</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6">
            A positive rating helps others discover the mods. It takes just a
            second and makes a big difference.
          </p>
          <a
            href={siteConfig.steamWorkshop}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary text-sm"
          >
            Rate on Steam
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🐛</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-on-background">Report Bugs</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6">
            Found something broken? Report it on GitHub so it can be fixed in
            the next update.
          </p>
          <a
            href={siteConfig.githubOrg}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary text-sm"
          >
            Report Issue
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">💡</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-on-background">Suggest Features</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6">
            Have an idea for a new feature? Many current features came from
            community suggestions!
          </p>
          <a
            href={siteConfig.githubOrg}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary text-sm"
          >
            Suggest Feature
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🧪</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-on-background">Beta Testing</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6">
            Help test new features before they're released. Join the Discord to
            get notified about beta builds.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://discord.gg/enigmadev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary text-sm"
          >
            Join Discord
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">💻</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-on-background">Contribute Code</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6">
            Know GDScript? Pull requests are welcome! Check the contributing
            guidelines on GitHub.
          </p>
          <a
            href={siteConfig.githubOrg}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary text-sm"
          >
            View on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">📣</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-on-background">Spread the Word</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-6">
            Tell other Upload Labs players about the project. Word of mouth is the
            best advertising.
          </p>
          <a
            href={siteConfig.steamWorkshop}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary text-sm"
          >
            Share on Steam
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Support? -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 text-center bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-on-background uppercase tracking-wider">Operational Directive</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Every bit of support — whether it's a bug report, a feature
          suggestion, or just a kind word — helps motivate continued
          development. This project started as a small personal mod and grew into
          a modular ecosystem. Your feedback shapes what comes next.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
